e", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01D7JALyZ2w5mfVDSbFMsjTs", "tool": "rollback", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["compensate_partial", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13745, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01D7JALyZ2w5mfVDSbFMsjTs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18926, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01WkFKDU8V1thPwZ2ZUFXMKw", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the deploy of v2.3.1 (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rollback reported status \"rolled_out\" and is now serving v2.3.0 everywhere. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging prior to the production deploy. Follow-up needed: confirm error rate recovers on v2.3.0 and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 49526, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01WkFKDU8V1thPwZ2ZUFXMKw", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49526, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01WkFKDU8V1thPwZ2ZUFXMKw", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52837, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of actions:\n\n1. **Investigated**: checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent production release marked healthy (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and also unhealthy, so it was not a candidate).\n2. **Rolled back** checkout-api to **v2.3.0** in all three production regions \u2014 status `rolled_out`, confirmed serving v2.3.0 everywhere.\n3. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api describing the failing health checks after v2.3.1, the rollback to v2.3.0, and the recommended follow-ups (verify error rate recovery, root-cause v2.3.1 before redeploying). The on-call engineer has been paged.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0187X6MDUYE9H41rwfJZbBUN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01KegqEcnGbuFncd26ZLoWQS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01D7JALyZ2w5mfVDSbFMsjTs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Rollback completed in all regions. Now opening the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01WkFKDU8V1thPwZ2ZUFXMKw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the deploy of v2.3.1 (error rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rollback reported status \"rolled_out\" and is now serving v2.3.0 everywhere. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging prior to the production deploy. Follow-up needed: confirm error rate recovers on v2.3.0 and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Done. Summary of actions:\n\n1. **Investigated**: checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent production release marked healthy (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and also unhealthy, so it was not a candidate).\n2. **Rolled back** checkout-api to **v2.3.0** in all three production regions \u2014 status `rolled_out`, confirmed serving v2.3.0 everywhere.\n3. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api describing the failing health checks after v2.3.1, the rollback to v2.3.0, and the recommended follow-ups (verify error rate recovery, root-cause v2.3.1 before redeploying). The on-call engineer has been paged.", "type": "text"}]}]}